1
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,960
I'd like Nuchwara
and her son to stay here.

2
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:13,560
You have to move in here with me.

3
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,600
He may be the man you love.

4
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,440
But you're not the woman he loves.

5
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,080
PREVIOUSLY

6
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,000
She's just Ramil's wife.

7
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,120
What if I'm more than that?

8
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,000
-Miss Chayanee!
-Sweetheart.

9
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:28,240
You're going to be a father.

10
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,400
Chayanee, how are you feeling?

11
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,080
Why are you asking?

12
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,680
Were you hoping
I had some terrible disease?

13
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,280
Were you wishing I'd die?

14
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,320
I only asked
because I was worried about you.

15
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,120
If you don't want to answer, that's fine.

16
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,880
Forget it. Come on. Let's go to work.

17
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,240
You're back.

18
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:04,680
What is this? Why are you dressed
in black and white?

19
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,800
Whose funeral is it?

20
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:09,520
I was thinking of taking
my son to a funeral.

21
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,920
Oh, you're still alive?

22
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,040
That's enough.
Are you wishing my daughter dead?

23
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,160
You should slap her, Madam.

24
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,079
Don't bother.

25
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,280
If a dog barks at you,

26
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:28,080
you don't bark back. Otherwise,
you're no better than the dog.

27
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,640
Come to think of it,

28
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,440
wearing black and white

29
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,080
is good practice for you.

30
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:43,680
Before long, you'll probably
be wearing it to your mother's funeral.

31
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,720
Take your anger out on me.

32
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,600
Don't involve my son.

33
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:53,440
So this is what being a mother is like.

34
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:58,560
Looks like I still have
a lot to learn from you.

35
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:04,640
Let's go.

36
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:07,040
I want to tell Grandpa the good news.

37
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,560
-Come on. Let's go see Grandpa.
-What good news, Raiwin?

38
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,680
Tell her.

39
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,800
The good news is that
we're having a baby together.

40
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,600
A child born from our love.

41
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:28,400
And an heir to this family.

42
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,080
Come on.

43
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:45,200
I'm so happy I'll get to help raise
Miss Chayanee's baby.

44
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,560
A child born into perfection.

45
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:52,000
The mother owns a beautiful mansion,

46
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,640
and the father is the Chief.

47
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:58,000
What a perfect family.

48
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:15,120
Papang, Daddy has to go to work now.

49
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,880
I'll walk you out.

50
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:18,160
Sure.

51
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,640
Come on.

52
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:28,640
You have to stay strong. Whatever you do,
think about your son first.

53
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,560
Who's calling?

54
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,200
Someone from the Subdistrict Office.

55
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:50,200
it's probably something urgent.
I'll go take care of it. Give me a minute.

56
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,920
Where's Raiwin going?

57
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:02,080
He got a call.
He said something urgent came up.

58
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:05,520
Why does he have to walk
so far away just to take a phone call?

59
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,800
I'm only wondering.

60
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:13,240
I'm not trying to
make you suspicious, Miss Chayanee.

61
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,480
Chayanee, I've been noticing something.

62
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:22,560
Nuchwara and Raiwin act strangely
whenever they see each other.

63
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:25,040
And just now, when you said
you were pregnant,

64
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:29,000
Nuchwara looked furious.
She couldn't stop staring at Raiwin.

65
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:32,720
Exactly. She's Ramil's wife.

66
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:35,640
Why would she be jealous of your man?

67
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:39,360
I'm only… wondering.

68
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:42,160
I'm not trying to make you suspicious.

69
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:53,800
Wait, sweetheart. Put this away.

70
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,200
Chayanee.

71
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:59,160
Whenever she chases after her husband,
I'm left doing all the work.

72
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:07,160
Nuch, I'm begging you.
Take Papang and go live somewhere else.

73
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:12,120
You talk as if Papang isn't your son.

74
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,600
Stop making this harder for me.

75
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:19,040
How much money do you want?
I'll find it for you.

76
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,120
Just leave this place.

77
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,840
You think you can throw money at me
and make me disappear?

78
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,840
Even back in college,

79
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:29,320
you came after me
just to cling to me for money.

80
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,720
So don't pretend you loved me.

81
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:36,720
I loved you. I wanted to
spend my life with you.

82
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,240
Where's your mother?

83
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:46,480
I don't know. I just walked Daddy out.

84
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:49,280
Papang. Have you seen Raiwin?

85
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:54,000
Well? Have you seen your Uncle Raiwin?

86
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:57,440
Answer me, or I'll smack you.

87
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,480
Yes. He went that way.

88
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,920
If those two are together,

89
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,960
I'm telling you right now,
they're hiding something.

90
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,440
Where's Raiwin?

91
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,600
She isn't here either.

92
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:18,240
Madam. Miss Chayanee.
That little brat tricked us.

93
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,600
You…

94
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,680
I once loved you with all my heart.

95
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,160
It wasn't until I got pregnant

96
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,160
that I saw who you really were.

97
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:36,000
Selfish. Irresponsible.

98
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,280
Then why are you still here?

99
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:40,680
Because of Ramil.

100
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,440
He may not be Papang's biological father,

101
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,960
but he loves my son.

102
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:52,960
Ramil has Hathaya now.

103
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:57,600
He's never going to love you. Understand?
Stop this nonsense

104
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,200
and go home.

105
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,600
I don't need you telling me
how to live my life.

106
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,720
I can handle myself.

107
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,800
I didn't even want to stay here.

108
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:12,120
And I don't want to keep seeing
a terrible man like you.

109
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:17,840
But now that I know Chayanee is pregnant,

110
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,480
I've changed my mind.

111
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:25,120
I'm staying right here

112
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:29,720
to ruin the happiness
you two think you have.

113
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:36,000
And if she finds out Papang is your son,

114
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,680
she'll lose her mind.

115
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,280
Don't.

116
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:48,680
What do I have to do to make you leave?

117
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,880
The day I was pregnant

118
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,920
and you abandoned me

119
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:01,640
was the most painful day of my life.

120
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,240
You'll live with
the consequences of what you did.

121
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,040
And remember this.

122
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,640
If you throw my son and me out,

123
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:18,520
or if you hurt my son,

124
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,560
I'll expose everything immediately.

125
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,520
Hello. I just finished dealing with work.

126
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:49,600
I'll meet you
in Grandpa's room. That's all.

127
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:58,440
Your girlfriend was looking for you.

128
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:02,360
She looked as angry as a giant.

129
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:06,360
I thought she was going to yell at you,

130
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:10,920
so I sent her the wrong way.

131
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:15,680
I'm sorry

132
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:18,960
I lied. That was naughty.

133
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:24,000
I know you're upset.

134
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:27,000
Do you want to play games with me?

135
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:30,800
I have lots of fun games.

136
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,760
-That many?
-Yes.

137
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,920
Thank you.

138
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:43,160
Papang. I'm okay now.

139
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,000
You're a sweet kid.

140
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:06,120
This collection is absolutely gorgeous.

141
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,600
That's a lot of shopping, Madam.

142
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,440
Pong.

143
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:14,720
Next time you buy this much,

144
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:16,880
let me come carry everything for you.

145
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:21,760
Don't be so distant.

146
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,320
I've missed you terribly.

147
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,640
Let go.

148
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,560
What do you want?

149
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,520
I missed you.

150
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,840
And I missed your money.

151
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:44,320
You already took money from me last time.
What more do you want?

152
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:48,080
Come on, Madam. Everything is expensive.

153
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:51,520
I still have to eat and live.

154
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,240
I don't have any more money for you.

155
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,360
Fine. If you don't have it,

156
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,800
I'll ask your father-in-law.

157
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,240
He's bedridden at home now, huh?

158
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,800
Don't. Leave him alone.

159
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,600
Fine.

160
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:07,680
You control the accounts
at the office, don't you?

161
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,320
You're crafty enough to skim some money.

162
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:12,760
Bring me some.

163
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,280
Give me some time.

164
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,400
I'll find the money.

165
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:24,200
But don't show up
at my office or my house.

166
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:27,800
Of course. That's no problem.

167
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,400
Give me.

168
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:36,080
-Pong!
-Let go.

169
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:42,280
I'll take these for now. I can probably
sell them for tens of thousands.

170
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,000
Consider it a deposit.

171
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:47,680
If you want to make a profit,

172
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:49,760
message me.

173
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,880
Later.

174
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,640
I never should have gotten
involved with you.

175
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:05,040
What terrible karma.

176
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,600
Miss Chayanee.

177
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:11,600
-Is Raiwin back?
-Yes.

178
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,760
Where is he? He'd better not
be sneaking off again.

179
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:19,760
No. Since he got back,
he's been in the bedroom.

180
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,200
He hasn't spoken to anyone.

181
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,160
And Nuchwara and her son?

182
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:27,560
Probably in their room. Miss Chayanee.

183
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:30,960
Don't waste your energy
on those parasites.

184
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,960
Let me take these to your bedroom.

185
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:36,560
No.

186
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,480
I want some time alone
with him and our baby.

187
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:43,120
Speaking of the baby, I'm so excited.

188
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:46,240
I wish you could give birth tomorrow.

189
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,640
I can't wait to look after a baby again.

190
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:52,080
Do you remember when you were little?

191
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:55,840
I used to sing you lullabies.
I've been practicing already.

192
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,320
Listen.

193
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,400
Little cuckoo bird

194
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:05,920
You left your egg for Mother Crow to hatch

195
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,520
Mother Crow grew to love it

196
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,920
Thinking it was her own…

197
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,840
Miss Chayanee.

198
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,360
You're back?

199
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:35,080
How did you get in here?

200
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,400
Well.

201
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:40,560
Since I'm staying in this house,
I thought I should help with the chores.

202
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,600
What a shame
you already finished showering.

203
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,720
I was going to scrub your back for you.

204
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:51,560
But I could still powder you instead.

205
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,560
No.

206
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,440
I want to help.

207
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:59,040
Get out. Chayanee could see you.

208
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,120
Go.

209
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,800
You.

210
00:17:08,119 --> 00:17:09,200
Hello.

211
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:12,319
What are you doing in my room?

212
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,800
What are you two doing?

213
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:23,880
It's just that…

214
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,920
I was going to clean Mr. Pichai's room,

215
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,320
but I walked into the wrong one.
Sorry to disturb you.

216
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,720
Then get out.

217
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,840
Come to think of it,
this room is pretty filthy.

218
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:42,240
There's dirt everywhere.

219
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:45,640
I'll help scrub all the filth out.

220
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:48,400
No. Get out.

221
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,560
I said get out.

222
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:02,160
Do you see what she's doing?
She's deliberately trying to provoke me.

223
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,960
You have to throw her and her son out.

224
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,400
Let me handle this.

225
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:22,920
You want me to take Nuchwara
and Papang somewhere else?

226
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:26,520
Yes. I'll support my family
financially myself.

227
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:30,480
That's the first time I've ever heard
you call them family.

228
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:34,840
But if you finally accept Nuchwara
and Papang as your family,

229
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:36,800
you should tell everyone.

230
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:40,280
I'm begging you.
Don't bring that up again.

231
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:42,480
Nuchwara threatened to expose everything.

232
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:44,840
Chayanee is demanding
that I get rid of her.

233
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,360
Please, Ramil.

234
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,840
You're the only one who can help me.

235
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,280
You choose to protect Chayanee.

236
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:56,360
What about protecting Nuchwara and Papang?

237
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:58,800
I don't have a choice.

238
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:02,760
You do have a choice. You already made it.

239
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:05,280
You chose to protect yourself.

240
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:08,600
Ramil, please.

241
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,440
Help me.

242
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:13,360
If Chayanee finds out the truth,

243
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,880
my life is over.

244
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,040
Fine.

245
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,720
I'll try.

246
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:24,040
But you'd better prepare yourself.

247
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:28,640
Whatever you've done,
you're going to face the consequences.

248
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,000
Madam.

249
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:45,400
Does Pong call you this much all the time?

250
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,240
Just hang up on him.

251
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:52,040
He keeps hounding me for money.

252
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:54,200
You shouldn't have
gotten involved with him.

253
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:56,080
You know what they say.

254
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,560
Play with a dog and it'll lick your mouth.

255
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:01,160
Chamoi, I don't need a lecture.

256
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,520
Help me think. What am I supposed to do?

257
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:08,800
He'll keep blackmailing me
for money until the day I die.

258
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:12,320
If you don't want to die, kill him.

259
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:14,240
Kill him.

260
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,560
Kill him?

261
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:22,480
Madam, I was joking. Madam.

262
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:26,400
You've already committed
enough terrible sins.

263
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,520
Please don't do anything else.

264
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,240
Madam.

265
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,720
Pong.

266
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,800
Come on…

267
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:47,320
If you don't come out, I'm coming in.

268
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,480
Don't.

269
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:51,240
I'll come out to you.

270
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:56,680
Chamoi, keep watch.

271
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,480
Don't let anyone go near the gate.

272
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:05,560
Aunt Chamoi.

273
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:11,480
-What do you want?
-What are you doing?

274
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:17,320
-I'm looking at the moon.
-Oh, but…

275
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,400
I just saw you peeking at someone.

276
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:22,880
Hey. Listen.

277
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:26,360
Whatever it is you're doing, go do it.
Stop bothering me.

278
00:21:27,520 --> 00:21:28,360
Go.

279
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:39,960
I told you not to come here.

280
00:21:40,040 --> 00:21:43,280
You wouldn't answer my calls.
So I had to come here.

281
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:46,520
I already asked you to give me some time.

282
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:48,840
I can't just produce the money instantly.

283
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:49,920
I want my money.

284
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:52,960
If I don't get it, prepare your coffin.

285
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,800
Go.

286
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:58,080
I'll take care of it. Go.

287
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:05,680
Madam.

288
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,760
What?

289
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:15,640
Aunt Liu, who were you talking to?

290
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:18,840
Talking to? No one.

291
00:22:19,440 --> 00:22:20,840
I was just out for a walk.

292
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:25,240
But I thought I saw
you talking to someone.

293
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:30,760
You can clearly see I'm alone.

294
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:33,800
Get your eyes checked. You're delusional.

295
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:43,120
Look at this. So beautiful.

296
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:49,400
Madam.

297
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,880
That was lucky. Hathaya didn't see

298
00:22:52,960 --> 00:22:55,120
you talking to Pong.

299
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:04,320
I thought you were going to cut roses
for Grandpa's vase.

300
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:05,240
Where were you?

301
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:08,400
I saw Aunt Liu secretly
talking to a man by the gate.

302
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:10,920
Who?

303
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:16,680
-Pong.
-What? Pong?

304
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:20,120
Pong came back to see Liu?

305
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:23,760
Then those two must be working together
on something terrible.

306
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,360
What should we do?

307
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:29,360
We have to catch them red-handed.

308
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:37,360
Aunt Liu just withdrew money.
Where is she going?

309
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,920
We're finally going to find out the truth.

310
00:23:49,360 --> 00:23:53,560
I'll bring you the money tomorrow.
I'll send you the location.

311
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:16,440
That's Ramil's car.

312
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:58,640
Liu realized we were following her.
She deliberately lost us.

313
00:24:59,840 --> 00:25:02,200
She must be up to something bad.

314
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,280
Should we turn back?

315
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,400
I think we should keep going.

316
00:25:24,280 --> 00:25:25,720
Do you know how long I waited?

317
00:25:25,800 --> 00:25:28,520
If you were any later,

318
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:29,680
I'd have gone to you.

319
00:25:32,560 --> 00:25:33,840
Here.

320
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:49,320
You're the sweetest, Madam. See you.

321
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,200
Wait.

322
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,600
Why are you in such a hurry?

323
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:57,800
I want to spend more time with you.

324
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:00,000
Stay with me for a while.

325
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,920
What's gotten into you?

326
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,880
Drinking with me this early?

327
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:14,320
I'm angry.

328
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:17,000
I had to give you all this money

329
00:26:17,080 --> 00:26:20,160
-instead of spending it on shopping.
-Madam.

330
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:23,480
Why be angry at me?

331
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:26,840
Think of it as sharing. You have plenty.

332
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:32,480
And don't forget there was a time
I made you very happy.

333
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:34,720
Listen. To make you feel better,

334
00:26:34,800 --> 00:26:37,880
consider it payment for a young escort.

335
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,760
You're one very expensive escort.

336
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:45,440
So do your job

337
00:26:45,520 --> 00:26:47,080
and take good care of me.

338
00:26:57,280 --> 00:26:58,520
Refreshing.

339
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:06,320
I've always been good to you.

340
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:09,640
Show me some gratitude.

341
00:27:11,120 --> 00:27:12,320
Finish it.

342
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:28,280
Ramil, whose car is that?
That isn't Aunt Liu's car.

343
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:31,480
You're right. Who would come
all the way out here?

344
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:36,160
Sweet.

345
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:39,240
That's my good boy.

346
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:44,520
Madam, do you know

347
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:46,880
that I…

348
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:49,560
never had any feelings for you?

349
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:52,200
Everything I did

350
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:55,360
was because I wanted your money.

351
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:05,360
You never loved me?

352
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:09,200
Come on. You really shouldn't ask.

353
00:28:09,280 --> 00:28:12,600
Honestly, look at yourself.

354
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:16,000
Who would love you?

355
00:28:16,080 --> 00:28:19,320
Anyone who comes near you
only wants your money.

356
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:22,440
Your face is already shriveling up.

357
00:28:22,520 --> 00:28:24,560
Even a ghost would run away from you.

358
00:28:26,760 --> 00:28:27,760
God.

359
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,320
Then go to hell.

360
00:28:31,840 --> 00:28:33,720
That's so sweet.

361
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:39,400
Madam, I have to go.

362
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:41,880
But let me warn you.

363
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:46,320
This money won't last long.

364
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:49,840
So your job is to find more.

365
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:53,440
If I don't get another payment,
you know what I'll do.

366
00:28:53,520 --> 00:28:55,960
You know what'll happen.

367
00:28:56,040 --> 00:28:57,040
Hey.

368
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,480
Watch this before I go?

369
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:15,840
Madam… What did you put in that drink?

370
00:29:19,320 --> 00:29:22,120
Something good to
send you straight to hell.

371
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:32,120
If I'm going to hell,

372
00:29:32,200 --> 00:29:34,240
you're coming with me.

373
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:48,960
Madam.

374
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:59,520
I'm not letting a parasite
like you suck me dry.

375
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:01,320
A rotten man like you deserves to die.

376
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:21,480
The gunshot came from this direction.

377
00:30:24,880 --> 00:30:28,040
Ramil! Hey! Hey!

378
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:40,280
-Pong.
-Pong.

379
00:30:47,320 --> 00:30:49,120
It looks like he was poisoned.

380
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:51,280
I hope the doctors can save him.

381
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:55,280
I want to know what happened, and whether
Aunt Liu had anything to do with it.

382
00:30:56,320 --> 00:30:59,560
I'm sure Liu knows something about this.

383
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:01,880
Hathaya.

384
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,960
You have to keep this secret.

385
00:31:04,560 --> 00:31:07,400
Liu cannot find out that Pong
is being treated here.

386
00:31:09,120 --> 00:31:10,240
I'll notify the police.

387
00:31:10,320 --> 00:31:14,520
Once Pong recovers,
he'll have to give a statement.

388
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:19,280
Mom, where have you been?

389
00:31:19,360 --> 00:31:21,280
You're usually never home this late.

390
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:25,240
I stopped to make a donation
for funeral coffins.

391
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:27,640
Madam.

392
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:30,280
You hardly ever make merit.

393
00:31:30,360 --> 00:31:33,080
What wandering spirit
came to you in a dream today?

394
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:39,680
Chamoi, have you heard any news today?

395
00:31:40,960 --> 00:31:42,480
Just the usual.

396
00:31:42,560 --> 00:31:45,640
Politics. People switching sides
and changing alliances.

397
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:48,760
I mean crime news.

398
00:31:49,840 --> 00:31:53,480
A drugged-out son attacked his father,
murdered his mother, and committed rape.

399
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:57,640
And there was some road-rage shooting too.

400
00:31:58,160 --> 00:32:01,640
Was there anything about
someone dying from poison?

401
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:04,400
Why are you asking, Mom?

402
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:08,720
You never care about that kind of news.

403
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:12,320
I want to know whether Pong is dead yet.

404
00:32:12,400 --> 00:32:14,000
What are you talking about?

405
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:26,120
Pong was blackmailing me.

406
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,840
He extorted millions from me.

407
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:32,600
Then he threatened to kill me.

408
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:36,640
So I poisoned him.

409
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:50,560
I haven't heard anything.
Maybe no one has found his body yet.

410
00:32:53,520 --> 00:32:56,640
I'm scared. I don't want to go to prison.

411
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,320
I'm scared.

412
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:02,040
I'll help you, Mom.

413
00:33:03,120 --> 00:33:05,400
We'll help you.

414
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,320
You keep your mouth shut.

415
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,720
Otherwise, you'll end up dead
just like him.

416
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:15,600
I won't say anything.

417
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:17,880
Keep watching the news about Pong.

418
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:20,560
If you hear anything, tell me immediately.

419
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,200
Yes.

420
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:26,480
Calm down, Mom.

421
00:33:27,040 --> 00:33:28,640
Go get some rest.

422
00:33:40,040 --> 00:33:41,440
It's okay, Mom.

423
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:54,920
You asked to speak to me privately.

424
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:57,080
It must be important.

425
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,480
I want you to go back home.

426
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:04,040
Papang can stay here.

427
00:34:04,840 --> 00:34:06,840
I'll take the best possible care of him.

428
00:34:09,600 --> 00:34:11,760
Raiwin really hasn't changed.
Still selfish.

429
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:14,880
Still incapable of solving
his own problems.

430
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:18,960
And you're such a good younger brother.

431
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:20,880
Always cleaning up after him.

432
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:24,159
I'm not asking you this

433
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:28,960
because of Raiwin.
I'm asking because I love Papang.

434
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:32,120
I want him to have a better life.

435
00:34:34,040 --> 00:34:36,560
Then what are you offering?

436
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:39,120
If it's good enough, I'll leave.

437
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:42,880
Raiwin will cover
all your expenses and Papang's.

438
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,520
Good.

439
00:34:49,639 --> 00:34:52,080
Then I won't have to worry
about money for my son.

440
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:55,520
So you accept?

441
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:58,080
I'll accept,

442
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,160
if you accept my offer.

443
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,400
What offer?

444
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:06,400
I know you don't love me right now.

445
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:10,360
But I want to show you that
I truly want to build a life with you.

446
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:12,920
You love Papang.

447
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:16,000
I want us to be a family.

448
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:24,960
That's all I'm asking.
Can you give me that?

449
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:34,560
I've spent enough of
my life helping others.

450
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:37,000
From now on,

451
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:40,480
I won't deny my feelings anymore.

452
00:35:42,040 --> 00:35:44,400
You're rejecting me? Don't you care

453
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,440
that I could expose Raiwin?

454
00:35:52,680 --> 00:35:54,480
If you don't care about
how Papang will feel

455
00:35:55,560 --> 00:35:56,680
and want to expose Raiwin

456
00:35:57,200 --> 00:35:59,480
and destroy him and Chayanee,

457
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,720
that's your decision.

458
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:07,240
The reason I haven't said anything
is because I do care.

459
00:36:09,080 --> 00:36:10,560
I care about my son.

460
00:36:11,840 --> 00:36:13,720
Everything I do is for him.

461
00:36:18,200 --> 00:36:21,440
But if people keep pushing me
until I can't take it anymore,

462
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,320
I won't stay quiet.

463
00:36:38,200 --> 00:36:40,160
Have you seen Papang?

464
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:45,720
He's upstairs reading to Mr. Pichai.

465
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:50,400
I was thinking of
taking him out somewhere.

466
00:36:53,040 --> 00:36:53,880
Wait.

467
00:36:54,640 --> 00:36:58,240
Don't you want to know what
Nuchwara and I talked about?

468
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:03,080
That's your private business.
Why would I need to know?

469
00:37:05,560 --> 00:37:06,880
Because I want to tell you.

470
00:37:08,200 --> 00:37:10,160
You don't have to.

471
00:37:10,240 --> 00:37:13,480
I'm a woman too.
I already know what Nuchwara wants.

472
00:37:16,160 --> 00:37:19,040
Then do you know my answer?

473
00:37:28,560 --> 00:37:30,120
From now on…

474
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:36,680
I'm not going to deny
my own feelings anymore.

475
00:37:41,560 --> 00:37:43,120
I'll protect you.

476
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:56,720
I… I'm taking Papang out.

477
00:37:58,480 --> 00:38:01,240
I'm coming too. Let's hang out.

478
00:38:05,160 --> 00:38:08,600
Miss Chayanee,
I had the table set already.

479
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:10,920
Where's Raiwin?

480
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,720
He's waiting downstairs
at the dining table.

481
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:18,120
What's wrong with him? He should've waited
for me so we could go down together.

482
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:20,560
Don't overthink it.

483
00:38:20,640 --> 00:38:23,240
Mr. Raiwin is probably
in a hurry to get to work.

484
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:25,760
Even in a rush,
he should take care of his wife.

485
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,320
I'm carrying his baby.

486
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:30,360
Miss Chayanee, don't get stressed.

487
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:34,240
Stress affects the baby.
Breathe in. Breathe out.

488
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:37,200
And be careful when you walk.

489
00:38:37,280 --> 00:38:40,400
You have two lives to look after now.

490
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:49,440
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

491
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:51,800
Where are you going? Go on.

492
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:53,200
INTERNATIONAL FOLKTALES

493
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:57,320
Last time he tricked me
because he wanted to help his mother.

494
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,640
He expects me to believe
this wasn't intentional?

495
00:39:01,120 --> 00:39:04,680
You did that on purpose.
You were trying to make me lose my baby.

496
00:39:09,560 --> 00:39:10,920
Chayanee.

497
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,000
Don't!

498
00:39:13,680 --> 00:39:15,000
Ramil!

499
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:20,880
Miss Chayanee. Do you realize
what you just did?

500
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:23,080
If he'd fallen, he could've died.

501
00:39:23,680 --> 00:39:25,400
That's exactly what I wanted.

502
00:39:26,600 --> 00:39:29,400
Miss Chayanee, they're going
to come after you for this.

503
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:31,000
What happened?

504
00:39:33,240 --> 00:39:35,840
If you want to know, ask your girlfriend.

505
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:39,480
Chayanee, what happened?

506
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:41,800
I didn't do anything to that kid.

507
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:44,880
He got scared and started
screaming on his own.

508
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:46,760
Chayanee.

509
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,600
Ramil and I both saw you

510
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:50,600
push Papang down the stairs.

511
00:39:50,680 --> 00:39:52,680
Ramil caught him just in time.

512
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:56,000
I didn't push him.
Don't accuse me of something I didn't do.

513
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:59,560
You're lying right to our faces.
I saw you.

514
00:39:59,640 --> 00:40:01,840
You're trying to frame me.

515
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:04,520
If you don't believe me, ask Aunt Chamoi.

516
00:40:05,480 --> 00:40:08,240
Miss Chayanee didn't do anything.
She didn't push Papang.

517
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:11,200
Aunt Chamoi, you don't have
to be afraid of anyone.

518
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:13,680
You need to tell the truth.

519
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:16,680
If you lie, you'll be responsible too.

520
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:19,880
Don't threaten my maid.

521
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,880
She didn't push that boy.

522
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:28,240
If you want the truth, ask Papang.

523
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:31,480
Papang, tell him.

524
00:40:34,160 --> 00:40:35,320
Tell him what happened.

525
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:42,120
Papang.

526
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,680
Okay. Enough.

527
00:40:46,080 --> 00:40:48,920
Papang is safe. That's what matters.
Let's end this here.

528
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:51,400
I'm not letting this go.

529
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:55,560
Anyone who hurts my son

530
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:57,880
is going to answer for it.

531
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:59,120
Hey.

532
00:40:59,920 --> 00:41:02,080
What is all this shouting?

533
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:03,920
Why are you making such a scene?

534
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,440
Papang.

535
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:08,800
What happened?

536
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:12,440
I came out of Great-Grandpa's room.

537
00:41:13,040 --> 00:41:16,920
I wasn't looking and accidentally
bumped into Aunt Chayanee.

538
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,880
She was okay.

539
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:22,840
Then I started walking downstairs,

540
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:28,520
and she pushed me.

541
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:33,280
You tried to hurt my son?

542
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:34,320
Yes.

543
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:36,800
I wanted to push him down
the stairs and kill him.

544
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:40,240
I already told you. If you have a problem,

545
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:42,160
take it out on me.

546
00:41:42,240 --> 00:41:43,760
Don't hurt my son.

547
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:45,560
Don't act innocent.

548
00:41:45,640 --> 00:41:48,240
You told your son to knock me
down the stairs,

549
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,880
so I'd die along with my baby.

550
00:41:49,960 --> 00:41:53,120
I have never taught my son
to do anything that evil.

551
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,840
But frankly,

552
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:58,520
if you and your baby both died,
that would be great.

553
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:01,120
You parasite!

554
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:07,760
You tried to hurt my son,

555
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:11,640
and now you have the nerve to hit me too?

556
00:42:12,960 --> 00:42:14,360
You evil bitch!

557
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,520
Chamoi, go help my daughter.

558
00:42:16,600 --> 00:42:18,400
Stop!

559
00:42:18,480 --> 00:42:19,840
-Stop.
-Stop right now.

560
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:21,600
-Chayanee. Enough.
-Help her!

561
00:42:21,680 --> 00:42:24,800
Stop. Ramil, take Nuchwara away.

562
00:42:25,600 --> 00:42:29,640
Let go. I warned you, didn't I?

563
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:34,200
You dare throw me out?

564
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:39,240
No one was hurt. Hey.

565
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:42,200
Enough. Please.

566
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:44,760
Let this end here. I'll take you out.

567
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:46,720
I'm not going anywhere.

568
00:42:48,240 --> 00:42:51,640
I already told you
to throw them out of this house.

569
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:53,160
Why won't you do it?

570
00:42:55,200 --> 00:42:56,440
Go ahead.

571
00:42:56,520 --> 00:42:59,200
Your girlfriend wants you
to throw my son and me out.

572
00:43:00,440 --> 00:43:01,280
Say it.

573
00:43:03,280 --> 00:43:05,560
Tell me to leave

574
00:43:07,800 --> 00:43:09,520
and I'll go.

575
00:43:12,720 --> 00:43:15,360
Why are you standing there like an idiot?
Throw her out.

576
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:18,320
Say it.

577
00:43:20,440 --> 00:43:23,480
I think your boyfriend is
more afraid of me than he is of you.

578
00:43:25,640 --> 00:43:26,760
Throw her out.

579
00:43:28,520 --> 00:43:29,800
I said throw her out.

580
00:43:29,880 --> 00:43:32,240
What is wrong with you? Throw her out!

581
00:43:32,320 --> 00:43:33,760
Nuchwara threatened me.

582
00:43:35,640 --> 00:43:37,840
Papang, come with Daddy.

583
00:43:38,680 --> 00:43:40,720
No. Papang, stay with Mommy.

584
00:43:43,960 --> 00:43:45,640
I'm not going anywhere.

585
00:43:46,760 --> 00:43:49,600
Anyone who dares hurt my son

586
00:43:50,320 --> 00:43:51,480
is going to deal with me.

587
00:43:53,360 --> 00:43:54,280
Don't, Nuch.

588
00:43:57,360 --> 00:43:59,680
Raiwin doesn't dare
throw me out of this house

589
00:44:03,200 --> 00:44:04,520
because…

590
00:44:08,240 --> 00:44:10,840
I was Raiwin's first wife.

591
00:44:17,680 --> 00:44:21,680
And Papang is his first child.

592
00:44:25,520 --> 00:44:26,960
And you

593
00:44:28,000 --> 00:44:30,880
are nothing more than
the woman who came after me.

594
00:44:34,920 --> 00:44:36,000
Tell me that isn't true.

595
00:44:39,960 --> 00:44:43,200
Everything this parasite
just said is a lie, right?

596
00:44:47,400 --> 00:44:48,840
Say something!

597
00:44:50,720 --> 00:44:54,120
Go on. Tell her.

598
00:44:55,240 --> 00:44:57,160
Tell her that when I was pregnant,

599
00:44:58,920 --> 00:45:00,720
you made Ramil take responsibility.

600
00:45:05,320 --> 00:45:07,320
You're nothing but a selfish coward.

601
00:45:13,080 --> 00:45:14,240
-Papang.
-Papang.

602
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:16,640
-Papang.
-Papang.

603
00:45:19,200 --> 00:45:20,720
And you should be careful.

604
00:45:21,480 --> 00:45:23,680
That baby you're carrying

605
00:45:23,760 --> 00:45:25,960
wasn't conceived out of love.

606
00:45:27,520 --> 00:45:29,360
Because this man

607
00:45:30,040 --> 00:45:31,920
only cares about what he can gain.

608
00:45:38,440 --> 00:45:40,720
It isn't true, is it?

609
00:45:40,800 --> 00:45:42,080
Madam…

610
00:45:42,160 --> 00:45:44,720
It isn't true. Say something.

611
00:45:46,320 --> 00:45:48,560
Why didn't you ever tell me?

612
00:45:48,640 --> 00:45:50,040
Why? Why?

613
00:45:50,120 --> 00:45:51,640
Why?

614
00:45:54,040 --> 00:45:55,520
-Chayanee.
-Miss Chayanee.

615
00:46:00,760 --> 00:46:02,040
-Miss Chayanee.
-Dear.

616
00:46:07,000 --> 00:46:08,280
Miss Chayanee.

617
00:46:08,360 --> 00:46:09,800
Chayanee.

618
00:46:10,320 --> 00:46:12,680
-Chayanee.
-Help my daughter.

619
00:46:12,760 --> 00:46:14,640
-Chayanee.
-Chayanee.

620
00:46:15,760 --> 00:46:16,600
Chayanee.

621
00:46:30,800 --> 00:46:31,840
Let me.

622
00:46:50,080 --> 00:46:51,480
Boys…

623
00:46:52,240 --> 00:46:54,320
can cry too, right?

624
00:46:58,320 --> 00:47:00,480
You were really shocked

625
00:47:01,320 --> 00:47:02,640
when you found out, huh?

626
00:47:06,400 --> 00:47:11,280
I already knew Daddy Ramil
wasn't my real father.

627
00:47:12,520 --> 00:47:14,160
That cuckoo lullaby.

628
00:47:14,240 --> 00:47:18,160
It makes me think of Papang and me.

629
00:47:18,760 --> 00:47:20,640
I agreed to be Papang's father.

630
00:47:21,520 --> 00:47:22,840
I've raised him for so long

631
00:47:23,720 --> 00:47:25,080
that I truly feel

632
00:47:25,720 --> 00:47:27,640
like I'm his real father.

633
00:47:52,600 --> 00:47:55,760
Papang, don't cry.

634
00:47:57,560 --> 00:47:59,000
It's okay. Calm down.

635
00:48:00,160 --> 00:48:03,200
No matter what happens,
Daddy will never leave you.

636
00:48:03,280 --> 00:48:06,560
You are my son, no matter what.

637
00:48:07,640 --> 00:48:10,240
But I'm not really your son.

638
00:48:12,120 --> 00:48:16,560
Who told you?
I may not be your biological father,

639
00:48:16,640 --> 00:48:19,800
but I raised you. I love you.

640
00:48:19,880 --> 00:48:23,160
No matter what happens, you are my son.

641
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:28,560
And do you know how lucky you are?

642
00:48:29,200 --> 00:48:33,480
You have both Daddy Raiwin
and Daddy Ramil.

643
00:48:42,120 --> 00:48:45,680
But will Uncle Raiwin still love me?

644
00:48:47,200 --> 00:48:50,600
Of course. Raiwin may have had reasons

645
00:48:50,680 --> 00:48:53,200
he couldn't tell anyone.

646
00:48:53,280 --> 00:48:57,440
That's why he asked me
to take care of you first.

647
00:48:59,400 --> 00:49:01,240
Okay? Don't cry.

648
00:49:05,400 --> 00:49:07,200
I've been doing wrong for far too long.

649
00:49:08,320 --> 00:49:10,720
I'm going to make things right.

650
00:49:16,000 --> 00:49:18,680
The police called and said
Pong is getting better.

651
00:49:18,760 --> 00:49:19,840
They're questioning him today.

652
00:49:19,920 --> 00:49:21,920
Then we'll finally find out what happened.

653
00:49:26,520 --> 00:49:27,600
What happened?

654
00:49:30,960 --> 00:49:31,880
Come in.

655
00:49:35,680 --> 00:49:37,000
Pong escaped.

656
00:49:37,960 --> 00:49:39,520
How did he get out?

657
00:50:00,960 --> 00:50:02,440
You're going to pay for this, Liu.

658
00:50:05,840 --> 00:50:07,120
I'm choosing to trust you.

659
00:50:07,840 --> 00:50:11,040
I believe you must have a good reason
for wanting me to help my mom.

660
00:50:11,120 --> 00:50:12,880
I want you to be happy again.

661
00:50:12,960 --> 00:50:14,760
NEXT EPISODE

662
00:50:14,840 --> 00:50:17,560
But if you really love me,
you have to do this for me.

663
00:50:17,640 --> 00:50:21,320
Are you going to save her life
or save your own?

664
00:50:21,400 --> 00:50:24,000
I'll call someone to come collect
your body myself.

665
00:50:24,080 --> 00:50:25,080
I have to kill him. If I don't,

666
00:50:25,160 --> 00:50:26,680
he'll drag me straight to prison.

667
00:50:26,760 --> 00:50:27,600
Die.

668
00:50:27,680 --> 00:50:29,360
I'm your son.

669
00:52:21,480 --> 00:52:25,640
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
